  skillName: "Thi\xEAn \u0110\xECnh Tru Th\u1EA7n Ti\u1EC5n Quy\u1EBFt"
  level: 29
  skillPoint: 100002
  description: " (\u5929\u9706\u8BDB\u795E\u7BAD\u8BC0) Tu s\u0129 d\u1EABn \u0111\u1ED9ng
    thi\xEAn t\u01B0\u1EE3ng, g\u1ECDi t\u1EDBi d\u1ECB t\u01B0\u1EE3ng v\u1EA1n
    l\xF4i t\u1EE5 v\xE2n. H\u1EAFc v\xE2n cu\u1ED3n cu\u1ED9n nh\u01B0 thi\xEAn
    ki\u1EBFp gi\xE1ng th\u1EBF, l\xF4i \u0111\xECnh cu\u1ED3ng b\u1EA1o x\xE9 to\u1EA1c
    th\u01B0\u01A1ng khung. Trong kho\u1EA3nh kh\u1EAFc s\xE1t c\u01A1 h\u1ED9i t\u1EE5,
    linh l\u1EF1c h\xF3a th\xE0nh kim s\u1EAFc l\xF4i ti\u1EC5n, mang theo uy \xE1p
    di\u1EC7t th\u1EA7n, xuy\xEAn ph\xE1 kh\xF4ng gian, tr\u1EF1c k\xEDch b\u1EA3n
    nguy\xEAn k\u1EBB \u0111\u1ECBch. M\u1ED9t ti\u1EC5n xu\u1EA5t \u2014 thi\xEAn
    \u0111\u1ECBa ch\u1EA5n \u0111\u1ED9ng, v\u1EA1n ph\xE1p ti\xEAu t\xE1n."
  icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a6196874f3968144c9ad0d5a814e311b, type: 3}
